sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant GW as Gateway<br/>(Istio/kgateway/GKE)<br/>80/TCP HTTP
    participant EPP as Endpoint Picker<br/>9002/TCP gRPC ext_proc
    participant Prefill as Prefill vLLM Pod<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Decode as Decode vLLM Pod<br/>8001/TCP HTTP
    participant Proxy as Routing Proxy Sidecar<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Redis as Redis<br/>8100/TCP
    participant HF as huggingface.co<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client, Redis: Flow 1: Inference Request (Prefill/Decode Disaggregated)

    Client->>GW: POST /v1/completions<br/>HTTP, No Auth
    GW->>EPP: ext_proc request<br/>gRPC/9002, No Encryption
    EPP->>EPP: Score endpoints<br/>(prefix/load/KV-cache/session aware)
    EPP-->>GW: Selected backend
    GW->>Proxy: Forward to decode pod<br/>HTTP/8000, No Encryption
    Proxy->>Decode: Proxy request<br/>HTTP/8001
    Decode->>Redis: Check KV-cache<br/>Redis/8100, No Auth
    Redis-->>Decode: Cache miss
    Decode->>Prefill: Schedule prefill<br/>HTTP/8000
    Prefill->>Prefill: Compute KV-cache
    Prefill->>Decode: Transfer KV-cache<br/>NixL/5557, No Encryption
    Prefill->>Redis: Store KV-cache metadata<br/>Redis/8100, No Auth
    Decode->>Decode: Generate tokens
    Decode-->>Proxy: Response
    Proxy-->>GW: Response
    GW-->>Client: JSON Response

    Note over Client, HF: Flow 2: Model Download (HF protocol)

    rect rgb(240, 240, 255)
        Client->>GW: kubectl apply ModelService CR
        Note over Prefill: Init container starts
        Prefill->>HF: Download model artifacts<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Bearer HF_TOKEN
        HF-->>Prefill: Model weights
        Note over Prefill: Model loaded, ready to serve
    end
